Architecture kit is usable. Import: import * as ARCH from '../arch/index.js'  (see the header of src/arch/index.js for the full API).
Key entry points: columnGeometry, brokenColumnGeometry, drumGeometry, roughBlockGeometry, entablatureFragmentGeometry,
capitalGeometry, pedestalGeometry, balustradeGeometry, peripteralTemple, prostyleTemple, tholos, stoa, propylon (Building → .finalize()),
